  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uzziah King of Judah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then all the people of Judah took Uzziah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "who was sixteen years old, and made him king in place of his father Amaziah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was the one who rebuilt Elath and restored it to Judah after Amaziah rested with his ancestors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziah was sixteen years old when he became king, and he reigned in Jerusalem fifty-two years. His mother's name was Jekoliah; she was from Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He did what was right in the eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", just as his father Amaziah had done.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He sought God during the days of Zechariah, who instructed him in the fear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of God. As long as he sought the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", God gave him success.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He went to war against the Philistines and broke down the walls of Gath, Jabneh and Ashdod. He then rebuilt towns near Ashdod and elsewhere among the Philistines.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God helped him against the Philistines and against the Arabs who lived in Gur Baal and against the Meunites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Ammonites brought tribute to Uzziah, and his fame spread as far as the border of Egypt, because he had become very powerful.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziah built towers in Jerusalem at the Corner Gate, at the Valley Gate and at the angle of the wall, and he fortified them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also built towers in the wilderness and dug many cisterns, because he had much livestock in the foothills and in the plain. He had people working his fields and vineyards in the hills and in the fertile lands, for he loved the soil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziah had a well-trained army, ready to go out by divisions according to their numbers as mustered by Jeiel the secretary and Maaseiah the officer under the direction of Hananiah, one of the royal officials.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The total number of family leaders over the fighting men was 2,600.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Under their command was an army of 307,500 men trained for war, a powerful force to support the king against his enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziah provided shields, spears, helmets, coats of armor, bows and slingstones for the entire army.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In Jerusalem he made devices invented for use on the towers and on the corner defenses so that soldiers could shoot arrows and hurl large stones from the walls. His fame spread far and wide, for he was greatly helped until he became powerful.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But after Uzziah became powerful, his pride led to his downfall. He was unfaithful to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his God, and entered the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to burn incense on the altar of incense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azariah the priest with eighty other courageous priests of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "followed him in.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They confronted King Uzziah and said, \"It is not right for you, Uzziah, to burn incense to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". That is for the priests, the descendants of Aaron, who have been consecrated to burn incense. Leave the sanctuary, for you have been unfaithful; and you will not be honored by the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziah, who had a censer in his hand ready to burn incense, became angry. While he was raging at the priests in their presence before the incense altar in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s temple, leprosy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "broke out on his forehead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Azariah the chief priest and all the other priests looked at him, they saw that he had leprosy on his forehead, so they hurried him out. Indeed, he himself was eager to leave, because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had afflicted him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King Uzziah had leprosy until the day he died. He lived in a separate house",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "—leprous, and banned from the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Jotham his son had charge of the palace and governed the people of the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The other events of Uzziah's reign, from beginning to end, are recorded by the prophet Isaiah son of Amoz.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziah rested with his ancestors and was buried near them in a cemetery that belonged to the kings, for people said, \"He had leprosy.\" And Jotham his son succeeded him as king.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
